       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in [builtin-raise ...] at stdlib/prelude.llt:2079:28-2079:47
   |
  2079 | """]: [fn [let msg@String] [builtin-raise msg]]
       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in [< ...] at 4:18-4:26
